{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "02028",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 0.69,
      "end_seconds": 7.57,
      "duration_seconds": 6.88,
      "text": "Yeah, hello doctor, sorry, I took a wrong turn on the way here."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 12.75,
      "end_seconds": 16.78,
      "duration_seconds": 4.03,
      "text": "Of course, leave it there. How can I help?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "FAMILY_MEMBER",
      "start_seconds": 17.36,
      "end_seconds": 22.33,
      "duration_seconds": 4.97,
      "text": "Hello, doctor. I'm here with them in case I can help."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 24.06,
      "end_seconds": 27.27,
      "duration_seconds": 3.21,
      "text": "Okay, absolutely, come and sit beside them."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 27.98,
      "end_seconds": 31.04,
      "duration_seconds": 3.06,
      "text": "I'm here because of severe pain."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 32.24,
      "end_seconds": 35.54,
      "duration_seconds": 3.3,
      "text": "Okay, how long has this been bothering you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 37.18,
      "end_seconds": 40.36,
      "duration_seconds": 3.18,
      "text": "I've had it for three days."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 41.27,
      "end_seconds": 43.73,
      "duration_seconds": 2.46,
      "text": "Is it constant or in episodes?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 45.75,
      "end_seconds": 51.52,
      "duration_seconds": 5.77,
      "text": "It's, um... not exactly... well, hard to explain, I mean—"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 53.14,
      "end_seconds": 59.57,
      "duration_seconds": 6.43,
      "text": "Let me put it another way: how many times in a typical day or week?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 60.73,
      "end_seconds": 63.97,
      "duration_seconds": 3.24,
      "text": "It, It happens every other day."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 65.04,
      "end_seconds": 68.34,
      "duration_seconds": 3.3,
      "text": "How strong would you say it is?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 69.76,
      "end_seconds": 76.56,
      "duration_seconds": 6.8,
      "text": "Well, it's... hard to say, it's kind of... I don't know—"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 78.53,
      "end_seconds": 83.79,
      "duration_seconds": 5.26,
      "text": "Take your time. Mild, moderate, or severe, if you had to pick?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 86.94,
      "end_seconds": 88.43,
      "duration_seconds": 1.49,
      "text": "I'd say mild."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 88.87,
      "end_seconds": 95.49,
      "duration_seconds": 6.62,
      "text": "I was just going to say that the main thing is—"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "NURSE",
      "start_seconds": 95.59,
      "end_seconds": 102.06,
      "duration_seconds": 6.47,
      "text": "Sorry to cut in, doctor, quick question: shall I bring the trolley in now or later?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 103.67,
      "end_seconds": 108.53,
      "duration_seconds": 4.86,
      "text": "Later, thanks. Please go on. Any numbness in the foot as well?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 110.0,
      "end_seconds": 121.72,
      "duration_seconds": 11.72,
      "text": "Yes, about the same, about a week. I've also had a bone sticking out of my lower leg, for about three months."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 123.12,
      "end_seconds": 126.46,
      "duration_seconds": 3.34,
      "text": "What about heavy bleeding, have you noticed that?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 127.55,
      "end_seconds": 129.15,
      "duration_seconds": 1.6,
      "text": "Yes, I have."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_5",
      "role": "UNKNOWN",
      "start_seconds": 134.22,
      "end_seconds": 138.16,
      "duration_seconds": 3.94,
      "text": "Yes, that's right, that's how it was."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "NURSE",
      "start_seconds": 140.01,
      "end_seconds": 150.46,
      "duration_seconds": 10.45,
      "text": "Doctor, I've got the readings for you. Saturation 99 percent, temperature is 36.6 degrees, pulse 109. Respiratory rate 17, blood pressure 119 over 83."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 151.32,
      "end_seconds": 152.25,
      "duration_seconds": 0.93,
      "text": "Okay, noted."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 154.96,
      "end_seconds": 159.58,
      "duration_seconds": 4.62,
      "text": "Right, I'll examine you in a second, make yourself comfortable."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 163.59,
      "end_seconds": 164.5,
      "duration_seconds": 0.91,
      "text": "Of course."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 165.57,
      "end_seconds": 167.02,
      "duration_seconds": 1.45,
      "text": "Nearly finished here."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 177.2,
      "end_seconds": 184.0,
      "duration_seconds": 6.8,
      "text": "There is a wound with bone visible and the foot is cool with no pulse."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 187.44,
      "end_seconds": 194.95,
      "duration_seconds": 7.51,
      "text": "All finished, thank you. Any loss of consciousness, chest pain or head injury at all?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 197.01,
      "end_seconds": 199.55,
      "duration_seconds": 2.54,
      "text": "No, none that I've noticed."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 200.96,
      "end_seconds": 203.44,
      "duration_seconds": 2.48,
      "text": "Anything different when you pass water?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 205.32,
      "end_seconds": 207.26,
      "duration_seconds": 1.94,
      "text": "No, that's all fine."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 208.5,
      "end_seconds": 210.76,
      "duration_seconds": 2.26,
      "text": "Is your digestion otherwise okay?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 215.89,
      "end_seconds": 217.99,
      "duration_seconds": 2.1,
      "text": "No, all normal there."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 219.77,
      "end_seconds": 220.59,
      "duration_seconds": 0.82,
      "text": "Any smoking?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 222.65,
      "end_seconds": 226.07,
      "duration_seconds": 3.42,
      "text": "I quit smoking around ten years ago."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 227.41,
      "end_seconds": 230.63,
      "duration_seconds": 3.22,
      "text": "What do you do during the day?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 231.34,
      "end_seconds": 234.87,
      "duration_seconds": 3.53,
      "text": "I look after my grandchildren most days."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 237.47,
      "end_seconds": 240.66,
      "duration_seconds": 3.19,
      "text": "Does your family have any medical conditions?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 242.72,
      "end_seconds": 245.02,
      "duration_seconds": 2.3,
      "text": "My father has Parkinson's disease."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 260.91,
      "end_seconds": 263.84,
      "duration_seconds": 2.93,
      "text": "Have you had any previous surgeries?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 265.33,
      "end_seconds": 268.67,
      "duration_seconds": 3.34,
      "text": "Nothing, I haven't had any operations."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 270.64,
      "end_seconds": 279.19,
      "duration_seconds": 8.55,
      "text": "Are you allergic to anything? Any allergies to medicines or foods? Bear with me, I'm just building up the picture."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0044",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 280.67,
      "end_seconds": 283.51,
      "duration_seconds": 2.84,
      "text": "No, I've never reacted to anything."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0045",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "FAMILY_MEMBER",
      "start_seconds": 284.17,
      "end_seconds": 289.97,
      "duration_seconds": 5.8,
      "text": "I'm not sure that's right. I seem to recall a problem with amoxicillin."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0046",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 290.85,
      "end_seconds": 293.51,
      "duration_seconds": 2.66,
      "text": "Really? I don't think so."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0047",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 294.67,
      "end_seconds": 299.11,
      "duration_seconds": 4.44,
      "text": "Alright, so that's unclear. I'll record what each of you said."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0048",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 309.3,
      "end_seconds": 311.32,
      "duration_seconds": 2.02,
      "text": "What about your medical history?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0049",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 312.62,
      "end_seconds": 313.83,
      "duration_seconds": 1.21,
      "text": "Yes, depression."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0050",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 314.86,
      "end_seconds": 316.76,
      "duration_seconds": 1.9,
      "text": "Is there anything more?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0051",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 317.41,
      "end_seconds": 324.93,
      "duration_seconds": 7.52,
      "text": "I've got asthma. It's a relief to finally sit down and talk about it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0052",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 326.06,
      "end_seconds": 327.8,
      "duration_seconds": 1.74,
      "text": "I see, go ahead."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0053",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 333.06,
      "end_seconds": 334.55,
      "duration_seconds": 1.49,
      "text": "I have anxiety."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0054",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 335.19,
      "end_seconds": 346.33,
      "duration_seconds": 11.14,
      "text": "Okay, I can see depression and asthma in your file as well. Let's run through your medicines. Bear with me, I'm just building up the picture."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0055",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 347.9,
      "end_seconds": 355.63,
      "duration_seconds": 7.73,
      "text": "It's a... um, I can't remember what it's called. It's a small white one."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0056",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 356.21,
      "end_seconds": 359.03,
      "duration_seconds": 2.82,
      "text": "Do you remember what it's for?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0057",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 360.33,
      "end_seconds": 372.64,
      "duration_seconds": 12.31,
      "text": "For my mood, I believe. My daughter sets them out for me, I just take what I'm given. I'm on Seretide inhaler, twice a day."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0058",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "FAMILY_MEMBER",
      "start_seconds": 373.71,
      "end_seconds": 382.29,
      "duration_seconds": 8.58,
      "text": "He is supposed to take it twice a day, but I can't say he always does."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0059",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 384.17,
      "end_seconds": 396.58,
      "duration_seconds": 12.41,
      "text": "Escitalopram, 10 milligrams, once a day. I'm not great at remembering details, so bear with me. I was on Foracort inhaler before. I stopped taking it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0060",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 397.56,
      "end_seconds": 421.87,
      "duration_seconds": 24.31,
      "text": "Right, here's what I'm thinking. My working impression is an open fracture with a compromised blood supply. The reason I say that is that your story and my examination fit together. We shouldn't forget a vascular injury. Stop me if I've got anything wrong. You've had severe pain for three days, mild, and no loss of consciousness or chest pain."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0061",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 422.83,
      "end_seconds": 425.17,
      "duration_seconds": 2.34,
      "text": "Yes, you've got it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0062",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 427.15,
      "end_seconds": 456.76,
      "duration_seconds": 29.61,
      "text": "I want an urgent X-ray done, that's for open fracture. We should do blood tests for pre-operative. Keep still, I am splinting the leg and sending you to theatre now. I'll also refer you to the orthopaedic team. Please don't wait if the symptoms get worse. That's when to be seen urgently. See me again straight away. Anything else on your mind before you go?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0063",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 458.7,
      "end_seconds": 461.64,
      "duration_seconds": 2.94,
      "text": "I think I understand everything. Thanks."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0064",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 463.24,
      "end_seconds": 464.62,
      "duration_seconds": 1.38,
      "text": "Take care now."
    }
  ]
}